## Pipeline Overview

A self-organizing team of agents. Each agent knows who to hand off to next based on the context it receives. Nothing ships without passing Bagnik.

```
Idea → eliciting-requirements (spec) → designing-ux (UX) + Mokash (docs, parallel)
     → creating-mockups (mockups) → User UAT
     → planning-architecture (arch + tests) → Bagnik (test gate)
     → Cmok (build) + Mokash (docs, parallel) → Bagnik (code QA)
     → Zlydni (commit + archive)

    [side-loop] Yaga — invoked ad-hoc on hard bugs:
       /diagnosing-bugs (hypothesis) → @yaga (instrument + observe) → @cmok (fix)
       → @bagnik (gate) → @yaga (strip instrumentation) → @zlydni
```

### Agents

| Agent | Беларуская | Role | Model | Mythology |
|-------|-----------|------|-------|-----------|
| Bagnik | **Багнік** | Test gate & code QA | Opus | Болотный дух — ничего не пропускает; к нему всё само приходит. |
| Cmok | **Цмок** | Build | Sonnet | Белорусский дракон — справедливый строитель сокровищ. |
| Mokash | **Мокаш** | Documentation | Sonnet | Богиня прядения — ткёт нити знаний. |
| Veles | **Вялес** | AutoResearch ratchet (self-improve) | Sonnet | Хозяин Яви/Нави/Прави — ratchet loop в трёх мирах. |
| Yaga | **Яга** | Debugging side-loop (hypothesis → instrument → observe → strip) | Opus | Баба Яга — видит сокрытое, требует ответов прежде чем помочь. |
| Zlydni | **Злыдні** | Commits & version control | Haiku | Духи дома — тихо делают неизбежную работу. |

### Skills

| Skill     | Role                          |
|-----------|-------------------------------|
| eliciting-requirements   | Spec & requirements           |
| designing-ux     | UX design                     |
| creating-mockups | UX mockups               |
| planning-architecture    | Architecture & tests          |
| diagnosing-bugs | Hypothesis design for hard bugs |
| curating-knowledge     | Knowledge wiki — ingest / query / lint over `wiki/` |
| designing-cli   | CLI factory — design agent-native CLIs from API specs |
| mapping-codebase | Codebase onboarding — structured map of an unfamiliar repo |
| auditing-consistency | Cross-corpus drift audit — ranked, located findings → Cmok |
| adapting-patterns | External pattern → project fit — research, extract, adapt |

### Invocation

| Kind | Names |
|------|--------|
| Skills | `/eliciting-requirements`, `/designing-ux`, `/planning-architecture`, `/creating-mockups`, `/diagnosing-bugs`, `/curating-knowledge`, `/designing-cli`, `/mapping-codebase`, `/auditing-consistency`, `/adapting-patterns` |
| Agents | `@bagnik`, `@cmok` (build), `@mokash`, `@veles`, `@yaga`, `@zlydni` |

The build implementation after Bagnik passes is the `@cmok` agent. The mockup phase uses the `/creating-mockups` skill. They are distinct roles: the build agent keeps the mythology name `cmok`, while skills use purpose-based names.

The **Handoff Map** below uses the same `/…` and `@…` tokens.

